(6642229, 992177, 94265, '<td valign="top">I like the title. Interesting take, I''d guess you might not be doing too well since it''s not a ''literal'' image of garbage but pollution is certainly a form of waste, so it fits for me. Love the lighting, the mixture of blue and purple tones is good. My only gripe is that the crop seems a shade too tall, I''d have perhaps tried to shoot from a bit further away in a landscape ratio, or cropped up over some of the puddle. <br/> <br/>Voting later.</td>', 'I like the title. Interesting take, I''d guess you might not be doing too well since it''s not a ''literal'' image of garbage but pollution is certainly a form of waste, so it fits for me. Love the lighting, the mixture of blue and purple tones is good. My only gripe is that the crop seems a shade too tall, I''d have perhaps tried to shoot from a bit further away in a landscape ratio, or cropped up over some of the puddle.  Voting later.', '2012-01-11 13:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6642230, 992189, 94265, '<td valign="top">It''s not often I say it but what interesting garbage, haha. Who knew rotten fruit could look so cool! Nice colours and focus. I think your ''set'' is an open notebook, very clever; the ring binder along the back doesn''t actually majorly bother me but the harsh light in the upper left corner does. I''d have perhaps tried pointing the light source in a different direction.<br/> <br/>Voting later.</td>', 'It''s not often I say it but what interesting garbage, haha. Who knew rotten fruit could look so cool! Nice colours and focus. I think your ''set'' is an open notebook, very clever; the ring binder along the back doesn''t actually majorly bother me but the harsh light in the upper left corner does. I''d have perhaps tried pointing the light source in a different direction. Voting later.', '2012-01-11 13:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
