(6642541, 991924, 94265, '<td valign="top">Love this idea and it''s technically a good shot (nice dof, clear focus, nice tones and light) but the fact that there is still alcohol in the bottle suggests he''s not done with it, which means it''s not garbage yet. Shame, as otherwise I love the shot; it just really should have been an empty bottle to fit the challenge. The quality of the shot still warrants a 6, I''d have rated higher were it not for the bottle being unfinished.</td>', 'Love this idea and it''s technically a good shot (nice dof, clear focus, nice tones and light) but the fact that there is still alcohol in the bottle suggests he''s not done with it, which means it''s not garbage yet. Shame, as otherwise I love the shot; it just really should have been an empty bottle to fit the challenge. The quality of the shot still warrants a 6, I''d have rated higher were it not for the bottle being unfinished.', '2012-01-11 19:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6642552, 992270, 94265, '<td valign="top">They look a wee bit like the Smash aliens, lol. Very cute little guys, nice focus and dof, teeny bit grainy but that kinda suits it. I don''t quite get the garbage relation though? If you fashioned these guys out of rubbish then you did a great job but it''s not really evident if that''s the case, they''re all too similar, like they were purchased. I might be missing an obvious joke but I can''t see the relation to the challenge.</td>', 'They look a wee bit like the Smash aliens, lol. Very cute little guys, nice focus and dof, teeny bit grainy but that kinda suits it. I don''t quite get the garbage relation though? If you fashioned these guys out of rubbish then you did a great job but it''s not really evident if that''s the case, they''re all too similar, like they were purchased. I might be missing an obvious joke but I can''t see the relation to the challenge.', '2012-01-11 19:51:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6642561, 992133, 135629, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot, mainly because at first I was like... where the hell is the garbage... and then the tree :)  Bravo for making it interesting.</td>', 'I like this a lot, mainly because at first I was like... where the hell is the garbage... and then the tree :)  Bravo for making it interesting.', '2012-01-11 20:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6642563, 991647, 135629, '<td valign="top">GREAT contrast in this photo, excellent B&amp;W!</td>', 'GREAT contrast in this photo, excellent B&W!', '2012-01-11 20:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6642566, 992075, 135629, '<td valign="top">Nice title to go with this one :)</td>', 'Nice title to go with this one :)', '2012-01-11 20:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6642570, 991736, 135629, '<td valign="top">A little tighter/lower more agressive angle, with beach behind, while also omitting the dark objects/rocks in the water would have made this a real hit. Great idea though.</td>', 'A little tighter/lower more agressive angle, with beach behind, while also omitting the dark objects/rocks in the water would have made this a real hit. Great idea though.', '2012-01-11 20:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6642581, 991930, 142483, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great photo... definitely an "appealing" photo of an otherwise unappealing subject (assuming the cans are the subject, not the beautiful little girl!). Well done</td>', 'I think this is a great photo... definitely an "appealing" photo of an otherwise unappealing subject (assuming the cans are the subject, not the beautiful little girl!). Well done', '2012-01-11 20:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6642584, 991817, 142483, '<td valign="top">Good shot, love the shallow DOF and the frost on the bottle, well done</td>', 'Good shot, love the shallow DOF and the frost on the bottle, well done', '2012-01-11 20:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6642585, 992237, 142483, '<td valign="top">Love the subject choice, the rodent is a nice touch</td>', 'Love the subject choice, the rodent is a nice touch', '2012-01-11 20:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6642588, 992201, 142483, '<td valign="top">Very literal "turn garbage into art", cannot fault the photo, it is really great</td>', 'Very literal "turn garbage into art", cannot fault the photo, it is really great', '2012-01-11 20:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6642589, 992177, 142483, '<td valign="top">Great concept, love the composition and the processing</td>', 'Great concept, love the composition and the processing', '2012-01-11 20:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6642590, 991601, 142483, '<td valign="top">Nice bright colours, they really catch the eye</td>', 'Nice bright colours, they really catch the eye', '2012-01-11 20:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6642591, 991952, 142483, '<td valign="top">One of my favourite shots of the competition. It''s interesting, well composed and processed, I like it</td>', 'One of my favourite shots of the competition. It''s interesting, well composed and processed, I like it', '2012-01-11 20:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6642592, 992131, 142483, '<td valign="top">Good use of B&amp;W</td>', 'Good use of B&W', '2012-01-11 20:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6642594, 992206, 142483, '<td valign="top">Great tones, and subject matter, nicely done</td>', 'Great tones, and subject matter, nicely done', '2012-01-11 20:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6642595, 991695, 94265, '<td valign="top">A nicely taken shot, good composition and I like the blue tones; I''m not sure how a lamp that clearly still works is garbage though.</td>', 'A nicely taken shot, good composition and I like the blue tones; I''m not sure how a lamp that clearly still works is garbage though.', '2012-01-11 20:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6642597, 991185, 142483, '<td valign="top">The only thing detracting from this photo for me is the crop, I think with a little more at the top and the left it would''ve "popped" more</td>', 'The only thing detracting from this photo for me is the crop, I think with a little more at the top and the left it would''ve "popped" more', '2012-01-11 20:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6642599, 992170, 142483, '<td valign="top">Great title. Without the title I may not have thought much of the image, but the title makes me look and it and laugh. One of my higher rated pics</td>', 'Great title. Without the title I may not have thought much of the image, but the title makes me look and it and laugh. One of my higher rated pics', '2012-01-11 20:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6642601, 992269, 142483, '<td valign="top">Very cute idea, definitely made an appealing photo out of something unappealing</td>', 'Very cute idea, definitely made an appealing photo out of something unappealing', '2012-01-11 20:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6642602, 991630, 142483, '<td valign="top">Very interesting image, how was the "ocean" created?</td>', 'Very interesting image, how was the "ocean" created?', '2012-01-11 20:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6642603, 992017, 142483, '<td valign="top">Nice mood from this shot, very dark and gloomy but I like it</td>', 'Nice mood from this shot, very dark and gloomy but I like it', '2012-01-11 20:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6642604, 991998, 142483, '<td valign="top">Very well done with the processing, looks like a HDR image. How was this done? Great work</td>', 'Very well done with the processing, looks like a HDR image. How was this done? Great work', '2012-01-11 20:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6642607, 992312, 142483, '<td valign="top">good photo, I like the reflection. Lighting and processing is good. But the subject matter is a little... boring? Not sure if that''s the right word, it just doesn''t keep my interest very long</td>', 'good photo, I like the reflection. Lighting and processing is good. But the subject matter is a little... boring? Not sure if that''s the right word, it just doesn''t keep my interest very long', '2012-01-11 20:29:50.000000', NULL, 1);
