(6642611, 991412, 142483, '<td valign="top">Not sure that this is garbage or unappealing (not to me anyway, lol), but I like it all the same. The colours really jump out and grab your attention.</td>', 'Not sure that this is garbage or unappealing (not to me anyway, lol), but I like it all the same. The colours really jump out and grab your attention.', '2012-01-11 20:30:53.000000', NULL, 1),
