(6642705, 991694, 142483, '<td valign="top">Perhaps the focus/grain is intentional, but it detracts from the image for me. I like the idea, very cute, would''ve rated a lot higher if the focus was sharp</td>', 'Perhaps the focus/grain is intentional, but it detracts from the image for me. I like the idea, very cute, would''ve rated a lot higher if the focus was sharp', '2012-01-11 21:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6642706, 991863, 142483, '<td valign="top">Not one of my favourites, the title suggests that the trash bag is the main subject matter of the image, but my eyes are drawn to the flower bed, then the tree, and only after that do I notice the trash</td>', 'Not one of my favourites, the title suggests that the trash bag is the main subject matter of the image, but my eyes are drawn to the flower bed, then the tree, and only after that do I notice the trash', '2012-01-11 21:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6642707, 991136, 142483, '<td valign="top">Without the title, I would''ve had no idea what this was! That''s not necessarily a bad thing. But the dreamy soft focus and colours just didn''t work for me here</td>', 'Without the title, I would''ve had no idea what this was! That''s not necessarily a bad thing. But the dreamy soft focus and colours just didn''t work for me here', '2012-01-11 21:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6642708, 992262, 142483, '<td valign="top">This kind of gives me a headache to look at, haha. There''s so much going on, criss-crossing and blurring and what not, my eye''s can''t focus on any one thing. It doesn''t necessarily make it a bad shot, it just doesnt appeal to me personally, it doesn''t make me want to keep looking at it</td>', 'This kind of gives me a headache to look at, haha. There''s so much going on, criss-crossing and blurring and what not, my eye''s can''t focus on any one thing. It doesn''t necessarily make it a bad shot, it just doesnt appeal to me personally, it doesn''t make me want to keep looking at it', '2012-01-11 21:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6642710, 991199, 142483, '<td valign="top">I''m not really a fan of noisy/grainy photographs, but that''s just my personal taste. I like the compositon, the B&amp;W and the subject matter, just don''t like the processing.</td>', 'I''m not really a fan of noisy/grainy photographs, but that''s just my personal taste. I like the compositon, the B&W and the subject matter, just don''t like the processing.', '2012-01-11 21:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
