(6642814, 992293, 141324, '<td valign="top">Real clean photo!!</td>', 'Real clean photo!!', '2012-01-11 23:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6642816, 992060, 141324, '<td valign="top">Nice picture really like the colors and how crisp they are.</td>', 'Nice picture really like the colors and how crisp they are.', '2012-01-11 23:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6642826, 991930, 10848, '<td valign="top">This is outstanding! Such a creative and colorful image. Perfect composition and light. Precious!</td>', 'This is outstanding! Such a creative and colorful image. Perfect composition and light. Precious!', '2012-01-11 23:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6642828, 992287, 10848, '<td valign="top">Like this one, creative, composition is terrific. The placement of the subject draws the eye and the shadow adds the perfect touch. Well done!</td>', 'Like this one, creative, composition is terrific. The placement of the subject draws the eye and the shadow adds the perfect touch. Well done!', '2012-01-11 23:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6642853, 991994, 54645, '<td valign="top">Needs a bra</td>', 'Needs a bra', '2012-01-12 00:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6642866, 991197, 142483, '<td valign="top">Love the interpretation, and the colour tones too. Well done, it captured my attention, what more do you want from a photograph?</td>', 'Love the interpretation, and the colour tones too. Well done, it captured my attention, what more do you want from a photograph?', '2012-01-12 00:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6642969, 991736, 142397, '<td valign="top">Awesome photo. Love to see it with the beach cropped out.</td>', 'Awesome photo. Love to see it with the beach cropped out.', '2012-01-12 07:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6642996, 991845, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the rabbit.</td>', 'I love the rabbit.', '2012-01-12 09:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6642997, 992277, 15711, '<td valign="top">WOW  I wonder how many people will get the symbolism.</td>', 'WOW  I wonder how many people will get the symbolism.', '2012-01-12 09:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643020, 992158, 142473, '<td valign="top">I think I understand what your take is here... that it''s human trash or garbage.  Not exactly meeting the challenge criteria... but interesting.<br/> <br/>Might be good for B&amp;W, might be worth over-exposing the majority of the shot to get more detail in the dark pigmented face.</td>', 'I think I understand what your take is here... that it''s human trash or garbage.  Not exactly meeting the challenge criteria... but interesting. Might be good for B&W, might be worth over-exposing the majority of the shot to get more detail in the dark pigmented face.', '2012-01-12 10:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643022, 992236, 142473, '<td valign="top">Very artsy take on the garbage challenge.  Technically it''s there.<br/> <br/>Doesn''t really evoke a lot of emotion though.  Feels maybe a bit too planned to me personally.  It does makes me wonder what the hole is that the picture was taken through.  Does a good job focusing on the subject.</td>', 'Very artsy take on the garbage challenge.  Technically it''s there. Doesn''t really evoke a lot of emotion though.  Feels maybe a bit too planned to me personally.  It does makes me wonder what the hole is that the picture was taken through.  Does a good job focusing on the subject.', '2012-01-12 10:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643024, 992109, 112539, '<td valign="top">Very creative and overall appealing with good color and compostition</td>', 'Very creative and overall appealing with good color and compostition', '2012-01-12 10:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643026, 991630, 142473, '<td valign="top">You did a good job making this look like a green screen or something.  I''m guessing you used a very small aperture to have relatively no depth of field.  I think that''s the thing this might be missing... depth of field?  It has a strange 3D look that tricks the eye.  Looks like the island is floating more than sitting on the table.<br/> <br/>Good luck!</td>', 'You did a good job making this look like a green screen or something.  I''m guessing you used a very small aperture to have relatively no depth of field.  I think that''s the thing this might be missing... depth of field?  It has a strange 3D look that tricks the eye.  Looks like the island is floating more than sitting on the table. Good luck!', '2012-01-12 10:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643027, 992287, 112539, '<td valign="top">Cleaver use of shadow with bright foreground. Appears 3d. Fits theme well</td>', 'Cleaver use of shadow with bright foreground. Appears 3d. Fits theme well', '2012-01-12 10:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643029, 991412, 112539, '<td valign="top">Not good representation of theme. Looks like red leaves. Since when are red leaves garbage?</td>', 'Not good representation of theme. Looks like red leaves. Since when are red leaves garbage?', '2012-01-12 10:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643030, 991758, 73981, '<td valign="top">It would''ve been better had I seen the other side where the can is open...this could easily be a product shot with some more editing. I like it...but it doesn''t scream garbage as much as an open ended can would''ve. 6</td>', 'It would''ve been better had I seen the other side where the can is open...this could easily be a product shot with some more editing. I like it...but it doesn''t scream garbage as much as an open ended can would''ve. 6', '2012-01-12 10:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643031, 992114, 73981, '<td valign="top">Blue I believe...10</td>', 'Blue I believe...10', '2012-01-12 10:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643032, 992302, 142473, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I can appreciate the high-tones here.  It really brings the table and the peels together and unifies the picture.<br/> <br/>Would have been interesting to try it without the peeler.  The peels and the table itself are interesting enough that they could have worked together.<br/> <br/>I like that the table lines are not in-line with the photo, adds interest.</td>', 'Nice shot.  I can appreciate the high-tones here.  It really brings the table and the peels together and unifies the picture. Would have been interesting to try it without the peeler.  The peels and the table itself are interesting enough that they could have worked together. I like that the table lines are not in-line with the photo, adds interest.', '2012-01-12 10:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643033, 992141, 112539, '<td valign="top">How is this representation of the theme garbage?</td>', 'How is this representation of the theme garbage?', '2012-01-12 10:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643034, 992201, 73981, '<td valign="top">You''re also in for a Blue...dang 10</td>', 'You''re also in for a Blue...dang 10', '2012-01-12 10:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643035, 991987, 142473, '<td valign="top">I like this one... like nature is fighting back against the garbage.  Good story, good composition.  Even looks like a little vignetting due to the crop.  Right amount of DOF too.</td>', 'I like this one... like nature is fighting back against the garbage.  Good story, good composition.  Even looks like a little vignetting due to the crop.  Right amount of DOF too.', '2012-01-12 10:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643036, 992170, 112539, '<td valign="top">I don''t get this one?? How does this say garbage? What does the title mean in reference to the photo?</td>', 'I don''t get this one?? How does this say garbage? What does the title mean in reference to the photo?', '2012-01-12 10:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643037, 991724, 142473, '<td valign="top">I feel like there''s more to the story here.  My eye wants to focus on the stuff in the background to make sense of this image.<br/> <br/>Interesting perspective... curious what this scene actually is.  Almost looks like garbage, but at the same time, looks like a rock is the main focal point.  Cheers.</td>', 'I feel like there''s more to the story here.  My eye wants to focus on the stuff in the background to make sense of this image. Interesting perspective... curious what this scene actually is.  Almost looks like garbage, but at the same time, looks like a rock is the main focal point.  Cheers.', '2012-01-12 10:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643039, 992185, 142473, '<td valign="top">This one stands out among the crushed can images to me.  They are more than just crushed cans, they have interest due to the brown spotting that has been transferred to them (I assume not rust) from the crushing machine.<br/> <br/>Pretty cool.</td>', 'This one stands out among the crushed can images to me.  They are more than just crushed cans, they have interest due to the brown spotting that has been transferred to them (I assume not rust) from the crushing machine. Pretty cool.', '2012-01-12 10:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643041, 992177, 142473, '<td valign="top">Technically a nice shot, but I''m honestly not seeing how it meets the challenge.  I guess those are garbage boxes?<br/> <br/>Or are you trying to imply the steam from the stacks is garbage?<br/> <br/>I''ll give it better marks because it''s a technically good image.</td>', 'Technically a nice shot, but I''m honestly not seeing how it meets the challenge.  I guess those are garbage boxes? Or are you trying to imply the steam from the stacks is garbage? I''ll give it better marks because it''s a technically good image.', '2012-01-12 10:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
