(6644367, 992137, 142473, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, but I think I would have tried to color adjust a bit more.  Maybe I just like that over-processed look?  Cheers!</td>', 'Nice capture, but I think I would have tried to color adjust a bit more.  Maybe I just like that over-processed look?  Cheers!', '2012-01-13 14:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6644374, 991276, 142473, '<td valign="top">I''m amazed that you could capture this in one shot.  Very impressive!</td>', 'I''m amazed that you could capture this in one shot.  Very impressive!', '2012-01-13 14:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6644548, 992240, 94265, '<td valign="top">The glare on the tobacco pack is quite harsh, a more diffused light might have been better; I''m not sure about the angle either, it sort of feel to me like looking at a wooden panelled wall, not a table and the things are somehow stuck to the wall sideways. I can''t stand smoking and I don''t care for smoking shots so a bit of personal bias on my part here but the subject really quite unappealing. Focus and colours are Ok.</td>', 'The glare on the tobacco pack is quite harsh, a more diffused light might have been better; I''m not sure about the angle either, it sort of feel to me like looking at a wooden panelled wall, not a table and the things are somehow stuck to the wall sideways. I can''t stand smoking and I don''t care for smoking shots so a bit of personal bias on my part here but the subject really quite unappealing. Focus and colours are Ok.', '2012-01-13 19:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6644549, 992184, 94265, '<td valign="top">Some good detail captured but without the title I wouldn''t know what it was, it''s not really evident so I can''t see garbage,  just old metal. Contrast could be a wee bit darker.</td>', 'Some good detail captured but without the title I wouldn''t know what it was, it''s not really evident so I can''t see garbage,  just old metal. Contrast could be a wee bit darker.', '2012-01-13 19:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6644550, 992132, 94265, '<td valign="top">Could have been an interesting mix of textures and colours but I don''t personally like the processing; I feel it''s been oversharpened and the saturation is up too high, especially on the reds. It makes the image too busy and a bit of an eye-strain to try and connect the different things.</td>', 'Could have been an interesting mix of textures and colours but I don''t personally like the processing; I feel it''s been oversharpened and the saturation is up too high, especially on the reds. It makes the image too busy and a bit of an eye-strain to try and connect the different things.', '2012-01-13 19:29:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6644552, 991993, 94265, '<td valign="top">Nice clear detail on the boot, good exposure. The image has a slightly pinky/peachy hue to it that I''m not personally keen on.</td>', 'Nice clear detail on the boot, good exposure. The image has a slightly pinky/peachy hue to it that I''m not personally keen on.', '2012-01-13 19:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6644554, 992287, 94265, '<td valign="top">Well done on remembering the hat and gloves, haha. I like this idea, nice focus on the garbage too. Not sure I like the lines of shapes surrounding the light but a good take on the challenge overall.</td>', 'Well done on remembering the hat and gloves, haha. I like this idea, nice focus on the garbage too. Not sure I like the lines of shapes surrounding the light but a good take on the challenge overall.', '2012-01-13 19:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6644555, 992139, 94265, '<td valign="top">Needs a little polishing, perhaps a more portrait-ratio crop; a more interesting light source would have been good, the rubber-looking background isn''t very attractive and darkening it would have helped in my opinion, plus I''m not sure what the cut up newspaper is meant to signify? Still, it''s in clear focus and I can see you''ve made an effort to be creative so points for that, is that a Kingsmill 50/50 wrapping? It makes an effectively colourful flower!</td>', 'Needs a little polishing, perhaps a more portrait-ratio crop; a more interesting light source would have been good, the rubber-looking background isn''t very attractive and darkening it would have helped in my opinion, plus I''m not sure what the cut up newspaper is meant to signify? Still, it''s in clear focus and I can see you''ve made an effort to be creative so points for that, is that a Kingsmill 50/50 wrapping? It makes an effectively colourful flower!', '2012-01-13 19:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6644556, 992216, 94265, '<td valign="top">Good DOF and sharpness, nice clarity on the subject.</td>', 'Good DOF and sharpness, nice clarity on the subject.', '2012-01-13 19:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6644557, 991136, 94265, '<td valign="top">This is a low scorer for me; I know it''s basic editing but those black specks are distracting, the image is a bit wishy washy, plus I can''t tell what the subject is at all. If it wasn''t stated in the title, I''d never guess.</td>', 'This is a low scorer for me; I know it''s basic editing but those black specks are distracting, the image is a bit wishy washy, plus I can''t tell what the subject is at all. If it wasn''t stated in the title, I''d never guess.', '2012-01-13 19:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6644605, 991952, 132305, '<td valign="top">Good. You should be in the front page.</td>', 'Good. You should be in the front page.', '2012-01-13 21:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6644608, 992206, 132305, '<td valign="top">Like the shadows! Good job</td>', 'Like the shadows! Good job', '2012-01-13 21:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6644610, 991858, 132305, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2012-01-13 21:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6644614, 992246, 132305, '<td valign="top">Congrats! maybe a little too far to the right, but still like it a lot. -9-</td>', 'Congrats! maybe a little too far to the right, but still like it a lot. -9-', '2012-01-13 21:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6644630, 992176, 94265, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the title? The image is a bit too soft overall, like it''s been treated with a softglow effect, which spoils it for me, would have rather had it more crisp. The sky is pretty blown-out too. Higher shutter speeds will help get a sharper focus and help tone down the brightness a bit too.</td>', 'I don''t get the title? The image is a bit too soft overall, like it''s been treated with a softglow effect, which spoils it for me, would have rather had it more crisp. The sky is pretty blown-out too. Higher shutter speeds will help get a sharper focus and help tone down the brightness a bit too.', '2012-01-13 22:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6644631, 991758, 94265, '<td valign="top">Very nice; crisp and clear, details on the can are sharp and although it''s a teeny bit blown out in places there is still detail in the snow. I like the central composition. This one should rank fairly high, top 10 I''d say. Nice job.</td>', 'Very nice; crisp and clear, details on the can are sharp and although it''s a teeny bit blown out in places there is still detail in the snow. I like the central composition. This one should rank fairly high, top 10 I''d say. Nice job.', '2012-01-13 22:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6644632, 991477, 94265, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if your colours are calibrated properly or what but that cup is bright pink, not red, lol. A nice and clear shot, some interesting textures and details.</td>', 'I''m not sure if your colours are calibrated properly or what but that cup is bright pink, not red, lol. A nice and clear shot, some interesting textures and details.', '2012-01-13 22:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6644633, 991852, 94265, '<td valign="top">I like the tones in this, the blues of the stones look nice beside the orange rust. I would have upped the red channel slightly actually to make the contrast between them pop. Good composition and exposure.</td>', 'I like the tones in this, the blues of the stones look nice beside the orange rust. I would have upped the red channel slightly actually to make the contrast between them pop. Good composition and exposure.', '2012-01-13 22:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6644634, 992141, 94265, '<td valign="top">Nice colours in the background but this doesn''t appear to fit the challenge, there isn''t any garbage. At a stretch I would say that maybe the day-glo colours are the work vest of a trash collector but it''s not particularly clear if that''s the case. Not a high scorer for me I''m afraid.</td>', 'Nice colours in the background but this doesn''t appear to fit the challenge, there isn''t any garbage. At a stretch I would say that maybe the day-glo colours are the work vest of a trash collector but it''s not particularly clear if that''s the case. Not a high scorer for me I''m afraid.', '2012-01-13 22:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6644637, 992109, 94265, '<td valign="top">Very creative use of garbage. I like the colour of the background, I especially like the little twisted spoon for some reason.  Nice and clear, good focus and composition. Highlights are awfully harsh on the knife but otherwise I love this.</td>', 'Very creative use of garbage. I like the colour of the background, I especially like the little twisted spoon for some reason.  Nice and clear, good focus and composition. Highlights are awfully harsh on the knife but otherwise I love this.', '2012-01-13 22:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6644638, 992293, 94265, '<td valign="top">Brilliant details on the dry mud cracks. Good dof and focus. The b&amp;w was a good choice as the lack of colour makes me focus on the textures and shapes. I like this a lot.</td>', 'Brilliant details on the dry mud cracks. Good dof and focus. The b&w was a good choice as the lack of colour makes me focus on the textures and shapes. I like this a lot.', '2012-01-13 22:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6644639, 992233, 94265, '<td valign="top">The angle is good, really clear focus on the outer rims of the tubes. The minty green is nice too, good job luv.</td>', 'The angle is good, really clear focus on the outer rims of the tubes. The minty green is nice too, good job luv.', '2012-01-13 22:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6644640, 991982, 142010, '<td valign="top"><strike></strike></td>', '', '2012-01-13 22:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6644721, 991952, 66398, '<td valign="top">So many textures and shades of brown and green. It''s amazing that such ugly trash could be so beautiful.</td>', 'So many textures and shades of brown and green. It''s amazing that such ugly trash could be so beautiful.', '2012-01-14 01:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6644751, 991630, 87305, '<td valign="top">Very creative use of a workshop ...how you did the lighting ?</td>', 'Very creative use of a workshop ...how you did the lighting ?', '2012-01-14 06:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6644752, 991758, 87305, '<td valign="top">I like this one, it''s one of the "the simplest, the better" images. Seems an advertisement...</td>', 'I like this one, it''s one of the "the simplest, the better" images. Seems an advertisement...', '2012-01-14 06:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
