(6645845, 992206, 69446, '<td valign="top">I like the tones. Perhaps a little dark/murky, but I can see how it would be hard to brighten without affecting the mood. I like it... 7.</td>', 'I like the tones. Perhaps a little dark/murky, but I can see how it would be hard to brighten without affecting the mood. I like it... 7.', '2012-01-15 22:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6645848, 991994, 69446, '<td valign="top">Very cute... I like it. I''m giving it an 8. I like the caption too.</td>', 'Very cute... I like it. I''m giving it an 8. I like the caption too.', '2012-01-15 22:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6645850, 991924, 69446, '<td valign="top">I guess you''ve focussed on the challenge description, "turn garbage into art this week by taking an appealing photo of a generally not-so-appealing subject"... however, the challenge title is "garbage" and this isn''t a photograph of garbage. I love people coming up with creative interpretations of challenge themes, but in this case I don''t think it fits. Sorry! :-7</td>', 'I guess you''ve focussed on the challenge description, "turn garbage into art this week by taking an appealing photo of a generally not-so-appealing subject"... however, the challenge title is "garbage" and this isn''t a photograph of garbage. I love people coming up with creative interpretations of challenge themes, but in this case I don''t think it fits. Sorry! :-7', '2012-01-15 22:58:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6645851, 992131, 69446, '<td valign="top">Lovely tones, and I love how the leaves show that the girders are a lot larger than they appear (at first I thought they were staples). Well done.</td>', 'Lovely tones, and I love how the leaves show that the girders are a lot larger than they appear (at first I thought they were staples). Well done.', '2012-01-15 22:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6645852, 991630, 69446, '<td valign="top">Hilarious. Great imagination :)</td>', 'Hilarious. Great imagination :)', '2012-01-15 22:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6645854, 991758, 69446, '<td valign="top">It''s a lovely photo (and I like the border), but it looks too clean to be garbage... it could be a promo shot from the alcohol company, enticing you to buy their beverage! Only the caption suggests that it''s garbage - not a strong enough link in my view. Challenge theme aside, a very nice image - well done.</td>', 'It''s a lovely photo (and I like the border), but it looks too clean to be garbage... it could be a promo shot from the alcohol company, enticing you to buy their beverage! Only the caption suggests that it''s garbage - not a strong enough link in my view. Challenge theme aside, a very nice image - well done.', '2012-01-15 23:01:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6645857, 991199, 69446, '<td valign="top">I like the grittiness of it, quite compelling in its own way. Interesting.</td>', 'I like the grittiness of it, quite compelling in its own way. Interesting.', '2012-01-15 23:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6645860, 992092, 69446, '<td valign="top">There isn''t much in this image to grab my attention; no unusual angle or creative use of lighting. It''s a flat picture of a tipped over rubbish bin. Have a look at the entries that score top ten, and see if you can learn from their interpretation of the challenge. Good luck!</td>', 'There isn''t much in this image to grab my attention; no unusual angle or creative use of lighting. It''s a flat picture of a tipped over rubbish bin. Have a look at the entries that score top ten, and see if you can learn from their interpretation of the challenge. Good luck!', '2012-01-15 23:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6645861, 991695, 69446, '<td valign="top">The lamp appears to have power; how is it garbage?</td>', 'The lamp appears to have power; how is it garbage?', '2012-01-15 23:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6645863, 992132, 69446, '<td valign="top">For my tastes, the "HDR look" is a bit strong in this image and the focus seems a little blurred. Maybe increase the DoF, to keep everything sharp.</td>', 'For my tastes, the "HDR look" is a bit strong in this image and the focus seems a little blurred. Maybe increase the DoF, to keep everything sharp.', '2012-01-15 23:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
