(6647551, 992117, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is interesting.  Complex simplicity bends perception in a very pleasing way.  It''s like an M C Escher.  Thank you.</td>', 'This is interesting.  Complex simplicity bends perception in a very pleasing way.  It''s like an M C Escher.  Thank you.', '2012-01-17 12:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6647553, 991197, 30364, '<td valign="top">I like this.  But then I''m also harmless and bald, so I had to.  It''s got a strange harmony about it.  Thank you.</td>', 'I like this.  But then I''m also harmless and bald, so I had to.  It''s got a strange harmony about it.  Thank you.', '2012-01-17 12:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6647554, 992293, 30364, '<td valign="top">Lovely paradox of scale in this picture.  I look for a party of tiny explorers somewhere.  A clever, simple photograph, which are the best kind.  Thank you.</td>', 'Lovely paradox of scale in this picture.  I look for a party of tiny explorers somewhere.  A clever, simple photograph, which are the best kind.  Thank you.', '2012-01-17 12:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6647555, 992314, 30364, '<td valign="top">The Cathedral of Street!  Font, an offering, a congregation of worshipers, and a stained glass window. You got it all beautifully!  Thank you.</td>', 'The Cathedral of Street!  Font, an offering, a congregation of worshipers, and a stained glass window. You got it all beautifully!  Thank you.', '2012-01-17 12:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6647556, 992243, 30364, '<td valign="top">All those chromatic cars, and a fabulous pile overwhelming all.  And no actual people at all.  This is very clever and interesting.  Terrific!  Thank you.</td>', 'All those chromatic cars, and a fabulous pile overwhelming all.  And no actual people at all.  This is very clever and interesting.  Terrific!  Thank you.', '2012-01-17 12:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6647559, 991905, 30364, '<td valign="top">Musical theme is impossible to ignore.  Staves and scales, in shape, light and tones.  I can''t resist seeing a set of headphones on the conductor.  Thank you.</td>', 'Musical theme is impossible to ignore.  Staves and scales, in shape, light and tones.  I can''t resist seeing a set of headphones on the conductor.  Thank you.', '2012-01-17 12:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6647561, 992216, 30364, '<td valign="top">Crazy simple, and all the better for that.  Elegant, seductive tones.  Love the title, too.  Thank you.</td>', 'Crazy simple, and all the better for that.  Elegant, seductive tones.  Love the title, too.  Thank you.', '2012-01-17 12:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6647563, 992234, 30364, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sense of aspiration in this picture.  Like a great secret revealed.  You knew exactly what you were doing!  Thank you.</td>', 'Beautiful sense of aspiration in this picture.  Like a great secret revealed.  You knew exactly what you were doing!  Thank you.', '2012-01-17 12:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6647565, 991477, 30364, '<td valign="top">The leaf!  It''s an excellent juxtaposition because it avoids appearing too forced.  Thank you.</td>', 'The leaf!  It''s an excellent juxtaposition because it avoids appearing too forced.  Thank you.', '2012-01-17 12:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6647568, 991852, 30364, '<td valign="top">Nice faux-echoes in the repeated shapes.  Simple and successful.  Well done and thank you.</td>', 'Nice faux-echoes in the repeated shapes.  Simple and successful.  Well done and thank you.', '2012-01-17 12:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6647586, 992276, 30364, '<td valign="top">Yes.  I like whimsical ambiguity like this.  It looks like a body wrapped while dancing a frenzied electric boogaloo, so the title was particularly well chosen.  Great fun!  Thank you.</td>', 'Yes.  I like whimsical ambiguity like this.  It looks like a body wrapped while dancing a frenzied electric boogaloo, so the title was particularly well chosen.  Great fun!  Thank you.', '2012-01-17 12:51:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6647631, 991992, 30364, '<td valign="top">Among the many clever things about this picture, my favourite is the anthropomorphic personality of the discarded hanger.  He does indeed appear to be serenading the night sky from a hilltop.  I wish I didn''t know who took this, so that I could give you a Thumb.  It''s beautiful, and wickedly clever.  Thank you.</td>', 'Among the many clever things about this picture, my favourite is the anthropomorphic personality of the discarded hanger.  He does indeed appear to be serenading the night sky from a hilltop.  I wish I didn''t know who took this, so that I could give you a Thumb.  It''s beautiful, and wickedly clever.  Thank you.', '2012-01-17 13:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6647634, 991950, 30364, '<td valign="top">It''s a kind of Jackson Pollock of trash, but with a religious icon superimposed.  Or maybe it''s just a flag, in which case I''d suggest it for the UN''s new standard.  Or the Vatican''s.  8.  Thank you.</td>', 'It''s a kind of Jackson Pollock of trash, but with a religious icon superimposed.  Or maybe it''s just a flag, in which case I''d suggest it for the UN''s new standard.  Or the Vatican''s.  8.  Thank you.', '2012-01-17 13:20:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6647637, 992075, 30364, '<td valign="top">It''s a pretty standard (though very good) street picture, but it fits the challenge like a glove with no fingers. Well seen and well done.  8. Thank you.</td>', 'It''s a pretty standard (though very good) street picture, but it fits the challenge like a glove with no fingers. Well seen and well done.  8. Thank you.', '2012-01-17 13:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6647643, 992133, 30364, '<td valign="top">Just a beautiful photograph.  Simple but complex; it can stand up to any amount of analysis and appreciation.  This is by any standard a superb picture.  9 and the sinister Order of the Thumb for you.  And a big thank you.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=800078" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Just a beautiful photograph.  Simple but complex; it can stand up to any amount of analysis and appreciation.  This is by any standard a superb picture.  9 and the sinister Order of the Thumb for you.  And a big thank you.', '2012-01-17 13:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6647666, 991836, 30364, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, clever, searingly original and bold in this company, and yet it still has the qualities to be popularly recognised as a Blue Ribbon picture.  The photograph works on every possible level  social commentary; uncommon vision; skilled yet restrained photographic craft; humour and wit; even as a faux-abstract presence.  There''s no box left unticked!  This should be the first time I have ever picked the winner.  10, an Order of the Thumb for those long winter nights, and a thank you.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=800078" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Beautiful, clever, searingly original and bold in this company, and yet it still has the qualities to be popularly recognised as a Blue Ribbon picture.  The photograph works on every possible level  social commentary; uncommon vision; skilled yet restrained photographic craft; humour and wit; even as a faux-abstract presence.  There''s no box left unticked!  This should be the first time I have ever picked the winner.  10, an Order of the Thumb for those long winter nights, and a thank you.', '2012-01-17 13:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6647718, 992245, 94265, '<td valign="top">Nice focus, good idea, wouldn''t have had the second cup behind the bottle as I feel it distracts a wee bit but overall I like this shot.</td>', 'Nice focus, good idea, wouldn''t have had the second cup behind the bottle as I feel it distracts a wee bit but overall I like this shot.', '2012-01-17 15:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6647720, 992076, 94265, '<td valign="top">The title is a bit long-winded but kinda good anyway, lol. I might have said biodegradable or something instead of recyclable. Nice vibrant colours, could be a wee bit sharper, composition could do with a tweak; I''d have perhaps included the full hand and shown the outskirts of the bin. Nice effort overall.</td>', 'The title is a bit long-winded but kinda good anyway, lol. I might have said biodegradable or something instead of recyclable. Nice vibrant colours, could be a wee bit sharper, composition could do with a tweak; I''d have perhaps included the full hand and shown the outskirts of the bin. Nice effort overall.', '2012-01-17 15:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6647722, 991990, 94265, '<td valign="top">I''m not totally sure what I''m looking at, I think it''s a melted lens and something else I can''t make out? Some interesting textures there, nice and crisp, I might have gone for colour to boost the interest a bit. A good shot overall, just not particularly eye-catching for me.</td>', 'I''m not totally sure what I''m looking at, I think it''s a melted lens and something else I can''t make out? Some interesting textures there, nice and crisp, I might have gone for colour to boost the interest a bit. A good shot overall, just not particularly eye-catching for me.', '2012-01-17 15:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
