(6649326, 992201, 114969, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by smardaz:</b></div><hr/><i> sometimes i think your photos become more about what you create than how you shoot it......i dunno if thats good or bad, just an observation</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>That''s no news, I claim from day #1 that all I care about is the result. If what I want requires a particular setup that can''t be found, I just create it: sounds logical to me.</td>', 'Originally posted by smardaz: sometimes i think your photos become more about what you create than how you shoot it......i dunno if thats good or bad, just an observation  That''s no news, I claim from day #1 that all I care about is the result. If what I want requires a particular setup that can''t be found, I just create it: sounds logical to me.', '2012-01-19 05:40:02.000000', NULL, 0),
