(6650747, 991197, 19825, '<td valign="top">This beautifully artistic image. It is wonderfully composed and your processing choices were inspired. Love the colors.<br/> <br/>Reminds me of my wife''s well wore doll I used in the recent Toy Story challenge. She loves that doll while the rest of the family thinks it looks a bit creepy. <br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=990186" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1503/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_990186.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1503/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_990186.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1503/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_990186.jpg"/></a></td>', 'This beautifully artistic image. It is wonderfully composed and your processing choices were inspired. Love the colors. Reminds me of my wife''s well wore doll I used in the recent Toy Story challenge. She loves that doll while the rest of the family thinks it looks a bit creepy.  ', '2012-01-20 15:39:26.000000', NULL, 0),
